+    * sync_read/write) and the two bitmaps must serialize under a per-renderer
+    * mutex (the vtest sock_mutex analog) before ANY concurrent-capable consumer
+    * -- do NOT ship one without it. The F2 free-on-refusal arm's invariant-break
+    * (a race-loser freeing the winner's handle) is already closed by warp_mem_
+    * new's errno discrimination (a duplicate -EINVAL keeps the handle marked, it
