+      /* F2: free the handle IFF the server slot is provably not installed --
+       * warp_mem_new returns rc>0 ONLY then (a wedged/ctx-less conn, an open
+       * failure that never reached the write, or the routine -ENOMEM holistic-
+       * cap refusal, whose Rlerror means the server installed nothing). That
